84
00:50:59.000 --> 00:51:36.000
Stefan made a one page signed statement, quote, As far as I can remember on Sunday October 5th this year, I was an inpatient at Manchester Royal where I was receiving treatment for an ankle injury. If I had been discharged from hospital on October 5th, I would have certainly have spent all that day at home as I was almost unable to walk at the time. Detectives later visited the Manchester Royal Hospital. Upon checking hospital records, they made a startling discovery. Stefan Kishko was not discharged on October 5th.

