00:52:44.000 --> 00:53:16.000
The three detectives on Stefan's doorstep asked him to accompany them to the police station to further discuss the incidents of indecent exposure. Stefan agreed. He also permitted police to search his bedroom and car. In his bedroom, police collected a soiled tissue from under his pillow and several adult magazines found down the side of his bed. At the police station, Stefan was again questioned about the weekend of October 4 and 5. He maintained he didn't leave the house as he was too weak after his visit to the hospital

