01:05:53.000 --> 01:06:31.000
To which Stefan replied, I have told you the truth, I remember the girl by the shop in broad lane and taking her to the moors, I must have stabbed her, that's how I showed you the bone handled knife. Stefan had changed his account again, he was back to confessing. His lawyer was no longer present when he confessed this second time. At 10.15pm that night Stefan was driven towards Halifax police station. The police car moved away from the lights of Rochdale and into the dark rolling hills of the moors.

