01:08:26.000 --> 01:09:07.000
out an attack, claws and knives. Inside his glove compartment was the list of registration numbers, including the one belonging to the Renault that passed the labire the afternoon of Leslie's disappearance. Stefan refused to offer an explanation why he noted this number down. The prosecution put forward that Stefan witnessed the car whilst at the labire with Leslie. Stefan's appearance strongly matched eyewitness Christopher Coverdale's account of the man he saw leading a child matching Leslie's description up to the mall that same afternoon. And of course, Stefan's own confession before he retracted it, stated he drove to the labire

